        "created_at": "2020-08-30T18:55:05.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I finally played spirit island and was instantly hooked. I knew pretty much immediately that I was going to buy all of the expansions for this game. I know that there is one being released soon but I was hoping to buy Branch and Claw in the meantime. I can't find it anywhere though and the gtg online store says there are a few hundred people waiting for it to be printed again. Are they waiting until the next expansion is out before reprinting Branch and Claw?</p>",
