        "created_at": "2020-08-30T21:48:41.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I'm not sure, but I know that many Kickstarter orders included Branch &amp; Claw, and wouldn't be surprised if they reprinted it in preparation for that. But then maybe they set aside a number of copies for that fulfillment.</p>\n<p>In any case, my understanding is the game continues to sell well, and they expect to keep it generally in stock.</p>",
